{"c":[{"name":"20261023T170937Z-2ed4854315f18992","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a mid-L4 release PR is a child of the working branch whose tip drops memory-bank/active, so main stays a Fresh /niko checkout. Do not merge that child back; the deletion would remove the working memory bank.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T174008Z-2f2719b3d24475d2","text":"After PR 150 lands, restore memory-bank/active from constrain-size-as-best-we-can onto a branch from main. Rebase onto the squash conflicts; a merge-commit rebase ends on main and drops the memory bank.","type":"note"}]}
